# Reuse, DRY, KISS

Prefer existing library components, hooks, and patterns over new ones. Search `src/components/` before adding a component.

- **Reuse** — compose or extend what exists; do not invent a sibling unless nothing fits
- **DRY** — share one implementation; do not copy-paste variants
- **KISS** — smallest change that works; no extra abstractions or process

```tsx
// BAD — new wrapper for the same control
function FancyButton(props) { return <button className="fancy" {...props} /> }

// GOOD — use Button and its existing variants/props
<Button kind="primary" size="m">{label}</Button>
```
